{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：03:40 2026-11-27 HKT<br/>發佈時間：03:40 2026-11-27 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：03:40 2026-11-27 HKT</p><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/509ad549a37ec1800a25dbcae6adc160/2026-11/2026-11-26_19_35_47.png\"/><p>屯門嘉和里山路一個住宅單位遭爆竊。周四（26日）下午1時19分，一名60歲姓李女住戶報案，指懷疑住所遭賊人潛入。</p><p>人員接報到場，發現單位其中一間房的窗戶被撬毀。女住戶初步點算後，相信損失一隻約值12萬元的手錶，以及總值約61萬元的金器，合共約73萬元。</p><p>案件列作「爆竊」跟進，暫未有人被捕。</p><p>最Hit</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-26T20:04:21.468925+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":228,"images":1,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-26T19:40:42+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-27T02:17:29.281035+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-26T19:57:49.285115+00:00","content_hash":"5aaed7ac9c89d96be725cc2a66945133db8dae622cdd17badd5ee4db4b8136ef","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}